       "text": "I entered the order as written: amlodipine 30 mg by mouth once daily (Order ID: ORD-0001).\n\nI added a note to the order saying the dose is above the usual 10 mg/day maximum and that you confirmed it was intended. The note also recommends pharmacy verification and close monitoring.\n\nBecause of the dose, I'd monitor blood pressure and heart rate closely, especially in the first hours after the first dose. I'd also watch for peripheral edema, dizziness, and signs of hypotension."
